t-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\">clique</text><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"46.0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f28e2c\" stroke=\"#a9631e\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"46.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\">near clique</text><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"63.0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#e15759\" stroke=\"#9d3c3e\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"63.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\">path</text><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#76b7b2\" stroke=\"#52807c\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"80.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\">paw</text><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"97.0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#59a14f\" stroke=\"#3e7037\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"97.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\">square</text><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"114.0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#edc949\" stroke=\"#a58c33\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-opacity=\"0.4\"/><text x=\"22.0\" y=\"114.0\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" dominant-baseline=\"middle\">star</text></g>\n</svg>\n<div id=\"ec-tooltip-1\" style=\"\n  display:none;position:absolute;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;\n  font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;pointer-events:none;\n  background:var(--ect-57425a7e);color:var(--ect-21ade003);\n  box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);max-width:min(260px,100%);box-sizing:border-box;\n  z-index:999;line-height:1.4;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\n\"></div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var tip=document.currentScript.parentElement.querySelector('#ec-tooltip-1');\n  var svg=document.currentScript.parentElement.querySelector('svg');\n  if(!svg||!tip) return;\n  // Next to the pointer but inside the plot (flipped to the pointer's left near the right edge),\n  // since anything past its edges is clipped, and scrolls, in a notebook or Quarto cell\n  function place(ev){\n    var r=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var x=ev.clientX-r.left+12,y=ev.clientY-r.top-10;\n    if(x+tip.offsetWidth>r.width) x=ev.clientX-r.left-12-tip.offsetWidth;\n    tip.style.left=Math.max(0,Math.min(x,r.width-tip.offsetWidth))+'px';\n    tip.style.top=Math.max(0,Math.min(y,r.height-tip.offsetHeight))+'px';\n  }\n  function show(el,ev){\n    var raw=el.getAttribute('data-attrs');\n    if(!raw) return;\n    try{var d=JSON.parse(raw)}catch(e){return}\n    var h='';\n    for(var k in d){\n      var v=d[k];\n      if(Array.isArray(v)) v=v.join(', ');\n      h+='<div><b>'+k+'</b>: '+v+'</div>';\n    }\n    if(!h) return;\n    tip.innerHTML=h;tip.style.display='block';\n    place(ev);\n  }\n  svg.addEventListener('mouseover',function(ev){\n    var t=ev.target;\n    if(t.hasAttribute('data-node')||t.hasAttribute('data-edge')) show(t,ev);\n  });\n  svg.addEventListener('mousemove',function(ev){\n    if(tip.style.display==='block') place(ev);\n  });\n  svg.addEventListener('mouseout',function(ev){\n    var t=ev.target;\n    if(t.hasAttribute('data-node')||t.hasAttribute('data-edge'))\n      tip.style.display='none';\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</div></div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Building blocks of the karate club\n\n`karate_club()` links the 34 members of a university karate club who met outside the\nclub, before it split in two. Of its groups of four members that are connected, most are\nstars and paths, as in any sparse network, but 85 are one friendship short of a clique\nand 11 are cliques:\n\n::: {#77805f68 .cell execution_count=4}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\nnames = {\n    \"motif_4e3_k591\": \"star\",\n    \"motif_4e3_k669\": \"path\",\n    \"motif_4e4_k1782\": \"square\",\n    \"motif_4e4_k735\": \"paw\",\n    \"near_clique_4\": \"near clique\",\n    \"clique_4\": \"clique\",\n}\nkarate = ec.karate_club()\n\n{names[motif]: n for motif, n in karate.motif_census(size=4).items()}\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=4}\n```\n{'clique': 11,\n 'star': 1098,\n 'path': 681,\n 'square': 36,\n 'paw': 452,\n 'near clique': 85}\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\nOn three nodes, the share of connected groups that are triangles sets networks apart.\nTeams in a football conference all play one another, so nearly a fifth of the groups\nare triangles in `football()`, and a quarter in `les_miserables()`, where characters\nmeet in the same scenes:\n\n::: {#082642b6 .cell execution_count=5}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\nnetworks = {\n    \"karate\": karate,\n    \"dolphins\": ec.dolphins(),\n    \"football\": ec.football(),\n    \"les_mis\": ec.les_miserables(),\n}\n{\n    name: round(census[\"triangle\"] / sum(census.values()), 2)\n    for name, graph in networks.items()\n    for census in [graph.motif_census()]\n}\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=5}\n```\n{'karate': 0.1, 'dolphins': 0.13, 'football': 0.19, 'les_mis': 0.25}\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n",
